    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3295" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăquĭlōnāris</span></b> ,
		e, adj.
		aquilo.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Northerly</i>, <i>northern</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regio tum aquilonaris, tum australis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					N. D. 2, 19, 50</span></i>
			 (but v. aquilonius).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Piscis aquilonaris, <i>a
				constellation</i>, <i>the Northern Fish</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
				6</span></i>; cf. Cic. Fragm. ix. 2, p. 580 Orell.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
